%!PS
/r { 0 0 3 -1 roll 1 rectfill } def
/p { 1 1 rectfill } def
/b { { 1 } { 0 } ifelse r } def
/Helvetica findfont dup /FontMatrix get aload pop 6 { r } repeat
/Helvetica findfont 12 scalefont /FontMatrix get aload pop 6 { r } repeat
/Helvetica findfont 12 scalefont /ScaleMatrix get aload pop 6 { r } repeat
/Helvetica findfont 12 scalefont 2 scalefont /ScaleMatrix get aload pop 6 { r } repeat
/Helvetica findfont [2 0 0 3 0 0] makefont /FontMatrix get aload pop 6 { r } repeat
/Helvetica findfont 10 scalefont [2 0 0 3 1 1] makefont /ScaleMatrix get aload pop 6 { r } repeat
/Helvetica findfont [1 2] makefont
5 [1 0 0 1 0 0] makefont
/Helvetica findfont 5 makefont
(x) 3 scalefont
7 findfont
